      "review_title": "Trailer and game are different",
      "review_description": "The trailer shows mining and playing with pets, but in the actual game its like a music player but with just one song, and the world is all small and theres the pets but you can move or touch them since theres no hands\n\nCan the developers please show the correct game inside the trailer, even if the actual music game is bad.",
