      "author_alias": "doalt",
      "developer_response": {
        "body": "Hey doalt! I'm sorry to hear you feel that way. All the first-person gameplay you see in the trailer was recorded in-game, it's as authentic as it gets. We'd be happy to talk more in-depth to find out where the disconnect is coming from here. We could even provide a 1-on-1 walkthrough in-game with you as well! :) You can get in touch with us in our community Discord at https://discord.gg/nomsters",
        "date": 1790302849
